OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely fine and dry day.
OL,6,FClear skies for the most, although
OL,7,Fsome cloud will build through the day
OL,8,Fwith possibility of some isolated
OL,9,Fshowers over northern hills. Light
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry and settled night, any
OL,13,Fcloud will give way with clearing
OL,14,Fskies across the region. Winds light
OL,15,Fand variable.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FClear skies at first
OL,18,Fbecoming cloudy during the afternoon,
OL,19,Fthough sunny spells are likely. Winds
OL,20,Flight and variable. Feeling hot.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
