OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith isolated showers of rain Sunday,
OL,7,Fclearing to sunny spells Monday and
OL,8,Fthrough Tuesday. Temperatures above
OL,9,Faverage for the time of year.
